ents good quality  matcha is bright vivid green and has a  fine powdery texture avoid anything that  is yellow in color of course it won't  taste good and typically good quality  matcha comes from Japan remember all  these tips so be sure to try all these  recipes make them for breakfast and let  me know which is your favorite in the  comments below don't forget to tag me at  Jonas or official and hashtag j-serve  recipes like this video share this video  and subscribe to my youtube channel for  a lot more healthy recipes workout  videos and also fitness tips do you also  turn on your notification button so that  you will get notified every time I share  a new video all the best
 

